      "Source": "Under the protection of giant fishes, you will not be actively attacked by some creatures. The more fish, the better the effect.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在巨型鱼类的庇护下，不会被部分生物主动攻击。在场鱼类越多，效果越强。","JA":""},
